1.5pt solid #000000;border-top:1pt solid #000000;padding:1.5pt 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:700;line-height:100%">25.9</span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">&#160;</span></td><td style="border-bottom:1.5pt solid #000000;border-top:1pt solid #000000;padding:1.5pt 1pt 1.5pt 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"></td><td style="border-bottom:1.5pt solid #000000;border-top:1pt solid #000000;padding:1.5pt 0 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">$</span></td><td style="border-bottom:1.5pt solid #000000;border-top:1pt solid #000000;padding:1.5pt 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">29.0&#160;</span></td><td style="border-bottom:1.5pt solid #000000;border-top:1pt solid #000000;padding:1.5pt 1pt 1.5pt 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"></td></tr></table></div><div style="padding-left:13.5pt;text-indent:-13.5pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">(a)</span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:4.3pt">Comprises $24.8 billion and $27.8 billion in deposits with banks, and $1.1 billion and $1.2 billion in cash and due from banks on the Consolidated balance sheets as of September&#160;30, 2026 and December&#160;31, 2025, respectively. </span></div><div style="margin-bottom:4pt;margin-top:4pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Also, as of September&#160;30, 2026 and December&#160;31, 2025, the Firm had the following other restricted assets: </span></div><div style="margin-bottom:4pt;padding-left:9pt;text-indent:-9pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">&#8226;</span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:4.95pt">Cash and securities pledged with clearing organizations for the benefit of customers of $55.6 billion and $44.9 billion, respectively. </span></div><div style="margin-bottom:4pt;padding-left:9pt;text-indent:-9pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">&#8226;</span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:4.95pt">Securities with a fair value of $36.1 billion and $40.8 billion, respectively, in relation to customer activity.</span></div><span></span>
</td>
